# Largest Number and Even/Odd Check (C++)

## Description
This program compares two integers and determines the largest number.
It also checks whether the largest number is even or odd.

## Concepts Used
- if–else conditions
- Nested if–else
- Modulus operator (%)
- Input/Output in C++

## Sample Input
enter the values of a and b: 8 7 
## Sample output
a is the largest number
a is an even number 


## Language
- C++
